    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will pilot mechanical vehicles and wield self-crafted spells to face off against legendary mages from eight factions in a fateful duel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Magical Strategy Combat</strong> Each battle randomly generates &quot;Elemental Blessings&quot; and spell scrolls. Combine staff attributes with battlefield conditions to create hundreds of combat styles. Uncover the world\u2019s secrets to unlock hidden storylines and ultimate challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Staff Workshop &amp; Magic Laboratory</strong> Forge staves with rare materials, customize core resonance frequencies and runic gems, and fuse magic from different schools to craft unique forbidden spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Battles Against Eight Legendary Mages</strong> Challenge diverse bosses: the &quot;Inferno Sovereign&quot; who manipulates lava to reshape terrain, the &quot;Chronomancer&quot; who reverses time to replicate your skills, and the &quot;Shadowweaver&quot; who lurks in dark dimensions to create illusions. Each fight integrates environmental mechanics, testing your strategy and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Battlefields &amp; Fantasy Vehicles</strong> Command steam-powered locomotives, mechanical colossi, and even ride dragons to become a Dragon Knight.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will pilot mechanical vehicles and wield self-crafted spells to face off against legendary mages from eight factions in a fateful duel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Magical Strategy Combat</strong> Each battle randomly generates &quot;Elemental Blessings&quot; and spell scrolls. Combine staff attributes with battlefield conditions to create hundreds of combat styles. Uncover the world\u2019s secrets to unlock hidden storylines and ultimate challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Staff Workshop &amp; Magic Laboratory</strong> Forge staves with rare materials, customize core resonance frequencies and runic gems, and fuse magic from different schools to craft unique forbidden spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Battles Against Eight Legendary Mages</strong> Challenge diverse bosses: the &quot;Inferno Sovereign&quot; who manipulates lava to reshape terrain, the &quot;Chronomancer&quot; who reverses time to replicate your skills, and the &quot;Shadowweaver&quot; who lurks in dark dimensions to create illusions. Each fight integrates environmental mechanics, testing your strategy and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Battlefields &amp; Fantasy Vehicles</strong> Command steam-powered locomotives, mechanical colossi, and even ride dragons to become a Dragon Knight.</p>",
    "short_description": "\u300aSanctum Mage\u300bis a magic-fantasy roguelite action-adventure game. you will: forge dynamic combat strategies, combine randomly empowered arcane blessings, and pilot enchanted war machines to break through swarms of foes.",
